### ❌错误标注（序号）
1. a extremely → extremely 元音发音开头，改为 an
2. a extremely representative Chinese traditional clothing → 形容词顺序：traditional Chinese；clothing 泛指衣物，garment 更合适
3. clothes of Man nation → 表达不地道，改为 the costumes of the Manchu people
4. It's line → It's=it is；这里是 “它的”，用 Its；line 改为 lines（多条线条）
5. brief → 形容服饰线条简洁，brief 不合适，改用 simple
6. large numbers of women → 语法没问题，但 numerous 更贴合四级书面表达
7. fasion → 拼写错误：fashion
8. important area → area 指地区；“场合” 是 occasion，复数 occasions
9. sympol → 拼写错误：symbol
10. east beauty → 东方的，the beauty of the East


