###【逐处错误标注】
1. greatly presentative → 拼写错误，presentative 应为 representative；缺少冠词 a；greatly 改为 highly 更地道
2. traditional female clothing → clothing 不可数，这里用 garment/dress 更合适
3. women's figure → 单复数错误，改为 women’s figures
4. aesthe → 拼写错误，正确是 aesthetics（美学）
5. QIpao → 大小写错误，Qipao
6. in vital occasions → 介词搭配错误，on important occasions
7. as well as becomes → 结构错误，as well as 不能这样连接两个谓语
8. orient beauty → 词性错误，orient 是名词，形容词 Oriental

